# An allowlist: everything is out of the build context, and only what the image
# is built from comes back in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!deploy
!packages/client/pyproject.toml
!packages/client/src
!providers/provider-contract/pyproject.toml
!providers/provider-contract/src

**/__pycache__

# The trees above are admitted whole, so what must never be in an image is named
# again here: a secret or a key nested inside would otherwise ride in on its parent.
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_*
